# The server images build from the repo root (compose.yaml, server/Dockerfile),
# since the server needs crates/. Send only the Rust workspace. The mcp image
# builds from mcp/ and uses mcp/.dockerignore.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!server/Cargo.toml
!server/src
!crates
crates/*/tests
crates/*/examples
